    "body": "Coordinator triage. The red run is 44995766211 on d911f4553 (a commit that changes only `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`). The gate job ran on runner uma from 06:53:49Z to 07:07:50Z.\n\n- The job ended as failed while its step \"Batch gate tier\" still shows `in_progress`, and the later steps are still `pending`. The log has no build error and no FAIL row. The runner lost the job in the middle of the step. This is a runner stop, not a build failure.\n- uma is online again and not busy.\n- Action: I started a re-run of the failed job. If it is green, this issue closes itself on the next green run. #3258 tracks the runner faults.\n",
